# Build artefacts
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# The corpus is a build artefact, not source. Generated images are reproducible
# with tools/mkcorpus, and adopted ones are usually real evidence that must not
# be published.
#
# manifest.json is excluded deliberately: committing it without the images it
# references would make a fresh clone fail to open them rather than skip the
# corpus test. What the corpus should contain lives in tools/mkcorpus instead,
# where it is version-controlled as code. See testdata/corpus/README.md.
testdata/corpus/*
!testdata/corpus/README.md

# Fuzzing corpora grow without bound and are machine-specific.
testdata/fuzz/
